# session/screenshots/burst/
# Raw memory-burst captures from the live mGBA harness, kept out of version
# control (regenerated on demand).
#
# Expected contents (gitignored — not committed):
#   snap_<n>.bin   consecutive raw RAM dumps (one file per sampled frame),
#                  used to diff memory across an event (e.g. end-of-turn) and
#                  find the byte(s) that change. See docs/LUA_AUTOMATION.md.
